Yes. Its a quest object, so it means that you have to be VERY well aligned
and of the right character class. If you fail that then you shouldn't be
able to use it.

>We could use a good description of alignment.  Seems its too easy to
>piss off lawful gods, how can you piss off chaotic gods?

Alignment: doing the things your god likes. If its Lawful then be nice to
friendly creatures. Same w/ Neutral. If you're a Knight then follow the code
of chilvary. If you're Chaotic then do whatever you want.

It may seem that Chaotics are the best then. Not so... there are now only
2 Chaotic artifacts- Grimtooth (oh boy!) and Stormy. Stormy has the unfortunate
ability to attack whatever happens to get in your way, whether its an enemy,
friendly, or tame. This can be particularly annoying in Chaotic temples and
when dealing w/ demon lords. Especially Orcus who is friendly but annoying.

You take your pick and accept the consequences.
